		{
			dependencies: [
				"33D3B6ADEDF7DC83"
				"72692432503FCF85"
				"465529C79295FFFF"
			]
			description: [
				"You may or may not have noticed that the &6Nether Portal&r you're used to making &cdoesn't work&r."
				""
				"Instead, you must craft &6Portaberries&r to move between dimensions easily. Eating an &6Infernal Portaberry&r will teleport you to the top of the world, where you be in a pocket of Netherrack in the Nether, or fall from the sky in the Overworld."
				""
				"&6Bring spare berries&r so you can get back! Portaberries &6aren't hard to automate&r, so you should probably do that!"
				""
				"Upon entering the dimension, however, you get &6Feather Falling and Fire Resistance for 30 seconds&r, so don't worry about falling into Lava or anything. It's enough to save you from a fall down to &6sea level&r, but not much further."
				""
				"This also means you can immediately return to the Overworld or Nether at &6any point&r. The 8:1 Overworld to Nether travel ratio &6still applies&r, so make sure you know where your base is."
			]
			id: "23C3E8FBF1DF4615"
			rewards: [{
